   "customData": {
    "author": "agent",
    "kind": "entity",
    "role": "node",
    "tooltip": "**Four active:** Market Feed, SEC EDGAR, News Stream, Portfolio DB.\n\n**One wired but off:** Macro Calendar — a config option, off by default since Aug 2026, kept in case a Fed week wants it back.\n\nThey are not interchangeable: one is ours, and the off one is the only one that ever bypassed both the Cutoff and enrichment."
   },
